WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.230
A purified protein fragment can look druggable, while

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:04.438
the

00:00:04.438 --> 00:00:07.849
living regulatory complex occupies many shapes and

00:00:07.849 --> 00:00:10.714
partnerships that a crystal cannot freeze.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.982
The therapeutic hypothesis should identify the

00:00:17.982 --> 00:00:21.718
disease-sustaining transcription-factor state and what

00:00:21.718 --> 00:00:25.315
biological transition a ligand is supposed to cause.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:33.215
A thermal-shift curve or impressive affinity does not

00:00:33.215 --> 00:00:36.742
establish a change in transcriptional function or a

00:00:36.742 --> 00:00:38.263
therapeutic phenotype.

00:00:41.925 --> 00:00:45.267
Engagement, conformation, chromatin occupancy and

00:00:45.267 --> 00:00:48.877
cellular response must be linked through experiments

00:00:48.877 --> 00:00:49.155
that

00:00:49.155 --> 00:00:51.065
can also disprove the claim.

00:00:54.842 --> 00:00:58.211
Belzutifan, TEAD inhibitors and mutant-p53

00:00:58.211 --> 00:00:59.174
reactivation

00:00:59.174 --> 00:01:03.262
illustrate distinct modes of controlling regulatory

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:03.663
state

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:06.105
rather than a universal method.

00:01:10.508 --> 00:01:14.286
The article argues for designing chemical programmes

00:01:14.286 --> 00:01:17.846
around regulatory states, measured biomarkers and

00:01:17.846 --> 00:01:20.534
exposure, not pocket discovery alone.
